---
// Think Different - Cinematic Scroll Presentation
// This template uses placeholder markers ({{KEY}}) that get replaced by md-to-html.py at runtime.
// During development, demo content is used instead.

import '../styles/global.css';

// Demo content for development - replaced by Python at build time
const isDev = import.meta.env.DEV;

const demoSeed = isDev ? 'How might luxury wellness appeal to Gen Z without losing its soul?' : '{{SEED_TOPIC}}';
const demoBrand = isDev ? 'Aesop' : '{{BRAND_NAME}}';
const demoDate = isDev ? '2026-03-24 14:30' : '{{DATE}}';
const demoWords = isDev ? '~800' : '{{WORD_COUNT}}';
const demoSource = isDev ? '28 turns, dyslexic composition' : '{{SOURCE_INFO}}';

const demoLines = isDev ? `
<div class="line-container">
  <span class="word-reveal">Wellness</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">isn't</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">aspirational</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">if</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">nobody</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">can</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">breathe.</span>
</div>
<div class="line-container mt-8">
  <span class="word-reveal">Luxury</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">sold</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">the</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">dream.</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">Gen Z</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">wants</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">the</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">receipt.</span>
</div>
<div class="line-container mt-8">
  <span class="word-reveal">The</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">body</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">knows</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">what</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">the</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">brand</span>
  <span class="word-reveal">forgot.</span>
</div>
` : '{{THE_LINES}}';

const demoInsight = isDev ? `
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">The Provocation</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Luxury wellness has a Gen Z problem, and it is not the one most people think. The issue is not price. It is not access. It is trust. A generation raised on ingredient lists and call-out culture does not respond to aspiration the way their parents did.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">The Landscape</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">I started where most people start, with the assumption that Gen Z wants wellness to be cheaper. That turned out to be wrong. What they want is for it to be honest. The wellness brands gaining traction are not the ones discounting. They are the ones showing their work.</p>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">There is a parallel in food culture. The farm-to-table movement did not make restaurants cheaper. It made them transparent. The price stayed the same. The trust went up.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">The Insight</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 text-xl text-center">Gen Z does not reject luxury. They reject performance. The brands that will win are the ones that stop selling transformation and start demonstrating function.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">The Tension</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Here is what kept me up. If you strip luxury wellness of its mystique, what is left? The spa is not just selling a treatment. It is selling a feeling of being taken care of. Radical transparency might destroy the very thing that makes wellness feel luxurious.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">The Experiment</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Take one hero product. Strip the copy back to function. Show the supply chain. Let customers see the maker. Run it for 90 days against the current version. If Gen Z engagement goes up without cannibalising the core audience, you have your answer.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section-panel scroll-section">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h3 class="subsection-title">Sources and Threads</h3>
    <p class="para-reveal text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 text-sinjin-grey">I drew on Patagonia's radical transparency playbook, the farm-to-table movement's trust mechanics, and Glossier's early community-first approach before they lost the plot.</p>
  </div>
</div>
` : '{{INSIGHT_CONTENT}}';

const demoBrief = isDev ? `
<div class="brief-card">
  <h3 class="text-sinjin-green font-bold text-xl mb-3">The Audience</h3>
  <p class="text-sinjin-text leading-relaxed">She is 24. She has a skincare routine she built from Reddit threads and dermatologist TikToks. She will pay for quality but not for mystique. She reads ingredient lists before she reads marketing copy.</p>
</div>
<div class="brief-card">
  <h3 class="text-sinjin-green font-bold text-xl mb-3">The Territory</h3>
  <p class="text-sinjin-text leading-relaxed">Wellness sits between healthcare and lifestyle. Gen Z is pulling it toward healthcare. The brands still treating it as lifestyle are losing relevance.</p>
</div>
<div class="proposition-block">The most luxurious thing a wellness brand can offer Gen Z is proof.</div>
<div class="brief-card">
  <h3 class="text-sinjin-green font-bold text-xl mb-3">Proof Points</h3>
  <p class="text-sinjin-text leading-relaxed">Ingredient sourcing transparency drives 34% higher trust scores in under-30 demographics. Brands showing supply chain outperform on repeat purchase by 2.1x.</p>
</div>
<div class="brief-card">
  <h3 class="text-sinjin-green font-bold text-xl mb-3">The Mandatories</h3>
  <p class="text-sinjin-text leading-relaxed">No aspirational language. Show, do not tell. Every claim must link to evidence. The aesthetic can be premium but the voice must be plain.</p>
</div>
` : '{{BRIEF_CONTENT}}';

const demoManifesto = isDev ? `
<div class="manifesto-para">
  <strong>Wellness is not aspirational if nobody can breathe.</strong>
</div>
<div class="manifesto-para">
  For too long, luxury wellness has traded on mystery. On the promise that if you just spent enough, something inside you would change. That model is breaking. Not because people stopped wanting to feel better, but because they started demanding to know how.
</div>
<div class="manifesto-para">
  Gen Z did not kill aspiration. They killed the bluff. They want the same quality. They want the same care. They just want to see the working. And the brands brave enough to show it will own the next decade of wellness.
</div>
<div class="manifesto-para">
  This is not about making luxury cheaper. It is about making it braver.
</div>
<div class="manifesto-para font-bold text-sinjin-green text-center text-2xl mt-12">
  Show the supply chain. Open the lab. Let the product speak.
</div>
` : '{{MANIFESTO_CONTENT}}';

// Show brand only if present
const showBrand = isDev ? true : false; // Python handles visibility at runtime
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{demoSeed} - Think Different</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Literata:ital,opsz,wght@0,7..72,400;0,7..72,700;1,7..72,400;1,7..72,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.7/dist/gsap.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.7/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.7/dist/ScrollToPlugin.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ── Hero ── -->
  <section data-section="hero" class="scroll-section relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8">
      {(showBrand || demoBrand) && (
        <div class="brand-lockup" data-brand-lockup>
          <div class="brand-name-text">{demoBrand}</div>
          <div class="brand-accent"></div>
        </div>
      )}
      <h1 class="hero-title font-bold text-sinjin-text leading-tight" style="font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
        {demoSeed}
      </h1>
      <div class="accent-line w-32 mx-auto mt-6"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-indicator">
      <div class="scroll-chevron"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Divider ── -->
  <div class="section-divider"></div>

  <!-- ── The Line ── -->
  <section data-section="the-line" class="scroll-section flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 text-center the-line-text">
      <Fragment set:html={demoLines} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Divider ── -->
  <div class="section-divider"></div>

  <!-- ── Insight Article ── -->
  {demoInsight && (
    <div data-section="insight">
      <Fragment set:html={demoInsight} />
    </div>
  )}

  <!-- ── Divider ── -->
  {demoInsight && <div class="section-divider"></div>}

  <!-- ── Creative Brief ── -->
  {demoBrief && (
    <section data-section="brief" class="scroll-section py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-sinjin-text mb-12 text-center">Creative Brief</h2>
        <Fragment set:html={demoBrief} />
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <!-- ── Divider ── -->
  {demoBrief && <div class="section-divider"></div>}

  <!-- ── Manifesto ── -->
  {demoManifesto && (
    <section data-section="manifesto" class="py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8">
        <Fragment set:html={demoManifesto} />
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <!-- ── Footer ── -->
  <footer data-section="footer" class="py-12 text-center">
    <div class="accent-line w-24 mx-auto mb-8"></div>
    <p class="footer-meta text-sinjin-grey text-xs mb-4">
      {demoDate} / {demoWords} words / {demoSource}
    </p>
    <p class="footer-credit">
      Document prepared using the
      <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@sinjin/think-different-framework">Think Different Framework</a>
      by
      <a href="https://sinjin.studio">Sinjin Studio</a>
    </p>
  </footer>

  <!-- ── Section Navigation ── -->
  <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Section navigation">
    <ul class="nav-dots"></ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- ── Scroll Animations ── -->
  <script>
    import { initScrollAnimations } from '../scripts/scroll.ts';
  </script>

</body>
</html>
